      "url": "https://www.zenml.io/blog/vector-databases-for-rag",
      "document_id": null,
      "title": "We Tried and Tested 10 Best Vector Databases for RAG Pipelines - ZenML Blog",
      "snippet": "le and high-throughput serving.\n* [Vespa](https://vespa.ai/): A full-featured search platform with vector support. Designed for billion-scale deployments.\n* [pgvector](https://github.com/pgvector/pgvector) (PostgreSQL): A Postgres extension for vector columns. Brings HNSW/IVF indexing to PostgreSQL’s relational engine.\n* [Elasticsearch](https://www.elastic.co/elasticsearch): A proven distributed search engine. Combines Elasticsearch’s mature text querying and filtering with vector fields.\n* [MongoDB](https://www.mongodb.com/) (Atlas Vector Search): A document database with built-in vector search. Supports hybrid full-text and embedding search, as well as rich JSON filtering.",
      "content_ref": "129487e40c4b88f3e8ec6396f559784b54546107c900df6542ff2d2c616eb6e6",
      "published_date": null,
      "retrieved_at": "2026-05-04T17:25:40.933208+00:00",
