      "document_id": null,
      "title": "Best Vector Databases in 2026: Complete Comparison Guide – Encore",
      "snippet": "If you want to try it out, deploy a working starter to your own AWS or GCP account — semantic search, OpenAI embeddings, and a small UI included:\n\nDeploy with Encore\n\nDeploy a pgvector starter with semantic search and OpenAI embeddings.\n\n[Deploy](https://app.encore.cloud/create-app/clone/ts-pgvector)\n\n[Pinecone: Best Managed Vector Database](#pinecone-best-managed-vector-database)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n[Pinecone](https://www.pinecone.io/) is a fully managed vector database offered as a cloud service. You get an API key, create an index, and start querying. No instances to size, no indexes to tune, no infrastructure to manage.\n\n**Key features:**",
      "content_ref": "9db117b0f3904c71010e765ed5c094e5c300619fe8a7aa2087331777b1e295e8",
      "published_date": null,
      "retrieved_at": "2026-05-04T17:25:41.294308+00:00",
      "query": null,
      "quality_score": null,
      "freshness_score": null,
