      "snippet": "### A/B Routing With Nginx: No Third-Party Tools Required](https://amitavroy.com/articles/ab-routing-with-nginx-no-third-part-tools-required)\n[![Multi-Cloud Redundancy: The Gap in Our Resilience Thinking](https://ik.imagekit.io/xqpqzbbjz/blog_images/main_thumbs/2026-03-19-multi-cloud-redundancy-gap-our-resilience-thinking.png?updatedAt=1775308350605)\n\nSystem design\n\n### Multi-Cloud Redundancy: The Gap in Our Resilience Thinking](https://amitavroy.com/articles/multi-cloud-redundancy-gap-our-resilience-thinking)\n[![PostgreSQL's GiST Exclusion Constraint: The Database-Level Answer to Double Bookings](https://ik.imagekit.io/xqpqzbbjz/blog_images/main_thumbs/2026-03-01-multi-cloud-redundancy-gap-our-resilience-thinking.png)\n\nSystem design",
