      "document_id": null,
      "title": "Best Open Source Vector Databases 2026 & Comparison",
      "snippet": "Redis SoftwareSelf-managed software with enterprise-grade compliance and reliability](/software/)\n  + [![Redis Open Source](https://cdn.sanity.io/images/sy1jschh/production/378b62e5358b1546ba6d1c7561379a188fb33e1c-64x64.svg)\n\n    Redis Open SourceIn-memory database for caching & streaming](/open-source/)\n  + [![Redis for AI](https://cdn.sanity.io/images/sy1jschh/production/47f07acfc279b313a7a56126f142736d67092c5b-64x64.svg)\n\n    Redis for AIFaster GenAI apps start here](/redis-for-ai/)\n\n  Tools\n  + [Redis LangCache](/langcache/)\n  + [Redis Insight](/insight/)\n  + [Redis Data Integration](/data-integration/)\n  + [Clients & Connectors](/docs/latest/develop/clients/)\n\n  Get Redis[Downloads](/downloads/)\n* [Resources](#)",
      "content_ref": "152549d896d977cbe943adfb357f0a99bb79b5f815526a0cb69af36dc80e3770",
      "published_date": null,
      "retrieved_at": "2026-05-04T17:25:40.790686+00:00",
      "query": null,
      "quality_score": null,
