      "snippet": "---\n\n      Copy Markdown Copied   [View as Markdown](/blog/choosing-a-vector-database.md)\n\n  \n\nSelf-hosted inference for search & document processing\n------------------------------------------------------\n\nCut API costs by 50x, boost quality with 85+ SOTA models, and keep your data in your own cloud.\n\n[Github   1.5K](https://github.com/superlinked/sie)   Contact us\n\n \n\n[![Superlinked](/diagrams/superlinked-logo-white.svg) Superlinked Inference Engine](/)  ![SOC2](/cdn/65dce6831bf9f730421e2915/69b2b2368eb4ae90247d86dc_SOC2.svg)\n\n© 2026 Superlinked. All rights reserved.\n\nPRODUCT\n\n[Docs](/docs/)[Models](/models)[Examples](/docs/examples)[VDB Comparison](/vector-db-comparison)\n\nABOUT\n\n[About us](/about)[Careers](https://jobs.superlinked.com/)[Glossary](/glossary)\n\nLINKS",
