      "title": "Vector databases (4): Analyzing the trade-offs • The Data Quarry",
      "snippet": "- [Client-server vs. embedded architectures](#client-server-vs-embedded-architectures)\n    - [Cost considerations](#cost-considerations)\n  + [2. Purpose-built vendor vs. incumbent vendor](#2-purpose-built-vendor-vs-incumbent-vendor)\n  + [3. Insertion speed vs. query speed](#3-insertion-speed-vs-query-speed)\n  + [4. Recall vs. latency](#4-recall-vs-latency)\n  + [5. In-memory vs. on-disk index and vector storage](#5-in-memory-vs-on-disk-index-and-vector-storage)\n  + [6. Sparse vs. dense vector storage](#6-sparse-vs-dense-vector-storage)\n  + [7. Full-text search vs. vector search hybrid strategy](#7-full-text-search-vs-vector-search-hybrid-strategy)\n  + [8. Filtering strategy](#8-filtering-strategy)\n* [Conclusions](#conclusions)\n* [Footnotes](#footnote-label)\n  \n\nAug 19, 2023\n\n18 min read",
      "content_ref": "c220dc87c0ce6680a00d5976ef6251a45e41893c0d761fc92f0e316144df693e",
      "published_date": null,
      "retrieved_at": "2026-05-04T17:25:42.427708+00:00",
