      "url": "https://www.zenml.io/blog/vector-databases-for-rag",
      "text": "* [Pinecone](https://www.pinecone.io/): A fully-managed cloud vector DB. Known for enterprise-grade reliability and scalability.\n* [Turbopuffer](https://turbopuffer.com/): An S3-based serverless vector + text search engine. Cost-effective with built-in hybrid search even on low tiers.\n* [Redis](https://redis.io/) (RediSearch): In-memory vector search via Redis Stack. Ultra-low-latency queries and flexible schema.5\n* [Weaviate](https://weaviate.io/): An open-source graph-based vector store. Features a GraphQL API and a modular design.\n* [Qdrant](https://qdrant.tech/): An open-source Rust vector database. Excels at real-time embedding search with rich JSON-based payload filtering.\n* [Milvus](https://milvus.io/) (Zilliz Cloud): Open-source, GPU-accelerated vector DB. Optimized for massive sca",
      "start_char": 7515,
      "end_char": 8315,
      "heading": null,
