      "method": "direct_http",
      "quote": "### 3. Milvus ![Milvus](https://i0.wp.com/lakefs.io/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/12-vector-databases-2023_milvus.png?resize=1024%2C538&quality=80&ssl=1) Milvus: <https://milvus.io/> Open source? Yes GitHub stars: 21.1k **What problem does it ",
