      "quote": "### 10. Vald ![Vald](https://i0.wp.com/lakefs.io/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/12-vector-databases-2023-vald.png?resize=1024%2C538&quality=80&ssl=1) Vald: <https://vald.vdaas.org/> Open source? Yes GitHub stars: 1274 **What problem does it sol",
