      "quote": "### 12. Pgvector ![Pgvector](https://i0.wp.com/lakefs.io/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/12-vector-databases-2023-pgvector.png?resize=1024%2C538&quality=80&ssl=1) Pgvector: <https://github.com/pgvector/pgvector> Open source? Yes GitHub stars: 4.",
