      "url": "https://www.altexsoft.com/blog/vector-databases-compared",
      "text": "[Milvus](https://milvus.io/) is a cloud-native vector database written in Go and C++. It is one of the most popular open-source vector databases, with 42k+ GitHub stars. It supports a wide range of index types for dense, binary, and sparse vectors, including FLAT, IVF, HNSW, and DiskANN.\n\n![Attu's Vector Search interface, showing a hybrid search with results displaying similarity scores and scalar metadata](https://www.altexsoft.com/static/content-image/2026/3/attu-s-vector-search-interface-showing-a-hybrid-se-23cde.png)\n\nAttu's Vector Search interface, showing a hybrid search with results displaying similarity scores and scalar metadata. Source: [Attu](https://github.com/zilliztech/attu)",
