      "method": "direct_http",
      "quote": "**[Company](https://www.altexsoft.com/company/)** * [CareersWe're hiring!](https://www.altexsoft.com/careers/) **Insights** * [Blogs](https://www.altexsoft.com/blog/) * [Travel News](https://www.altexsoft.com/travel-industry-news/) * [Techt",
