      "text": "Jonathan Rowny on September 15th, 2025\n\n![What's the best vector database for building AI products?](/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fthe-most-comprehensive-guide-to-choosing-the-right-vector-database-in-2025%2Fthe-most-comprehensive-guide-to-choosing-the-right-vector-database-in-2025.jpg&w=2048&q=90)\n\nSeptember 15th, 2025·23 min read\n\n* ![Picture of Jonathan Rowny](/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpeople%2Fjonathan-rowny.jpg&w=96&q=75)Jonathan Rowny\n\nShare article\n\nCopy link\n\n[AI](/blog?tags=ai)[Vector database](/blog?tags=vector-database)[RAG](/blog?tags=rag)[Machine learning](/blog?tags=machine-learning)\n\nReady to get started?\n---------------------\n\nJoin thousands of companies using Liveblocks to build multiplayer experiences for people and agents.\n\n[Get started for free](/auth/signup)",
