      "quote": "### 1. On-prem vs. cloud hosting[#](#1-on-prem-vs-cloud-hosting) A lot of vendors stress on their “cloud-native” feature as though it’s the best thing since sliced bread, from a scalability perspective. However, in deciding what solution wo",
